<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Founders 100 - CRIPFCnt SCOI Institutional Research Access</title>
  <meta name="description" content="CRIPFCnt SCOI Founders 100: Institutional Research Access Membership. 100 SCOI report selections, 5 named users, longitudinal revisions. Only 100 founding memberships." />
  <style>
    :root{
      --navy:#0F1C2E; --navy2:#1E3A5F; --gold:#C9A961; --gold2:#E5D4A6;
      --ink:#0F1C2E; --paper:#F8F9FA; --line:rgba(201,169,97,.28); --muted:#5b6b7f;
    }
    *{box-sizing:border-box}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;color:var(--ink);background:var(--paper);line-height:1.55}
    .wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}
    a{color:inherit}
    /* HERO */
    .hero{background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--navy),var(--navy2));color:#fff;padding:72px 0 64px;position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    .hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% -10%,rgba(201,169,97,.18),transparent 55%)}
    .hero .wrap{position:relative}
    .kicker{letter-spacing:.32em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:12px;color:var(--gold2);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin-bottom:18px}
    .hero h1{font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,50px);line-height:1.08;margin:0 0 16px;font-weight:700}
    .hero h1 .u{color:var(--gold2)}
    .lede{font-size:clamp(16px,2.2vw,20px);max-width:720px;color:#dfe7f2}
    .counter{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-top:26px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);
      border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:999px;padding:10px 18px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px}
    .dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--gold)}
    .ctaRow{margin-top:30px;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .btn{display:inline-block;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:.02em;
      border-radius:8px;padding:15px 28px;text-decoration:none;cursor:pointer;border:0}
    .btn-gold{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),#b8954f);color:var(--navy)}
    .btn-gold:hover{filter:brightness(1.06)}
    .btn-ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--line);color:#fff}
    .tag{margin-top:30px;font-style:italic;color:var(--gold2);font-size:18px}
    /* SECTIONS */
    section{padding:58px 0}
    .eyebrow{letter-spacing:.28em;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:12px;color:var(--navy2);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;margin:0 0 10px}
    h2{font-size:clamp(24px,3.4vw,34px);margin:0 0 10px}
    .sub{color:var(--muted);max-width:640px;margin:0 0 30px}
    /* PRICE CARDS */
    .tiers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px}
    .tier{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:30px;position:relative}
    .tier.feature{border-color:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 18px 50px -24px rgba(15,28,46,.5)}
    .badge{position:absolute;top:-12px;left:30px;background:var(--navy);color:var(--gold2);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
      font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:6px}
    .price{font-size:44px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy)}
    .price small{font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:400}
    .tier h3{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--navy2);margin:0 0 6px}
    ul.feat{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:18px 0 0}
    ul.feat li{padding:9px 0 9px 28px;position:relative;border-top:1px solid #eee;font-size:15px}
    ul.feat li:before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:16px;width:12px;height:7px;border-left:2px solid var(--gold);
      border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold);transform:rotate(-45deg)}
    /* RIGHTS strip */
    .rights{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:34px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:26px}
    .rights .cell h4{color:var(--gold2);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 8px}
    .rights .cell p{margin:0;color:#dfe7f2;font-size:15px}
    /* math */
    .math{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;background:#fff;border:1px dashed var(--gold);border-radius:12px;padding:22px 26px}
    .math b{font-size:30px;color:var(--navy)}
    /* final cta */
    .final{background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--navy2),var(--navy));color:#fff;text-align:center;border-radius:16px;padding:52px 28px;margin:10px 0 0}
    .final h2{color:#fff}
    .final p{color:#dfe7f2;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 26px}
    .soldout{background:#fff3f3;border:1px solid #e3b7b7;color:#8a2b2b;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 20px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px;margin-top:22px}
    .memberbar{background:#eef7ee;border:1px solid #bcdcbc;color:#1f5a2a;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin-top:22px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14px}
    footer{padding:34px 0;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}
    @media(max-width:760px){ .tiers{grid-template-columns:1fr} .rights{grid-template-columns:1fr} }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="kicker">CRIPFCnt SCOI · Founding Cohort</div>
      <h1>The <span class="u">Founders 100</span><br/>Institutional Research Access Membership</h1>
      <p class="lede">{{libraryCount}} SCOI reports already available. A single founding membership opens a standing institutional window into the Structural Causation of Outcome Index - for a tenth of the per-report rate.</p>

      <div class="counter">
        <span class="dot"></span>
        {{#if soldOut}}All 100 founding memberships issued{{else}}<strong>{{remaining}}</strong>&nbsp;of 100 founding memberships remaining{{/if}}
      </div>

      <div class="ctaRow">
        {{#if membership}}
          <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/founders/portal">Go to your membership portal →</a>
        {{else if soldOut}}
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/scoi">Browse the SCOI library</a>
        {{else}}
          <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/founders/checkout">Become a Founding Member · US$5,000</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#terms">See what's included</a>
        {{/if}}
      </div>

      {{#if membership}}
        <div class="memberbar">You already hold Founding Membership #{{membership.membershipNumber}}. Manage it in your <a href="/founders/portal" style="color:#1f5a2a;text-decoration:underline">portal</a>.</div>
      {{/if}}

      <div class="tag">CRIPFCnt - Recalibrate. Don't Motivate.</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section id="terms">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Membership Terms</p>
      <h2>Two payments. A lifetime right.</h2>
      <p class="sub">Founding members pay once to join, then a nominal annual fee to keep the window open and growing.</p>

      <div class="tiers">
        <div class="tier feature">
          <span class="badge">First Year</span>
          <h3>Join the cohort</h3>
          <div class="price">US$5,000 <small>/ first year</small></div>
          <ul class="feat">
            <li>Select <strong>100 SCOI reports</strong> from the available research library</li>
            <li>Effective allocation price of <strong>US$50 per report</strong></li>
            <li>Access for <strong>5 named institutional users</strong></li>
            <li>Includes <strong>longitudinal revisions</strong> tied to each selected report's original reference date</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="tier">
          <span class="badge">From Year Two</span>
          <h3>Annual renewal</h3>
          <div class="price">US$250 <small>/ year</small></div>
          <ul class="feat">
            <li>Retain access to all previously selected reports</li>
            <li>Receive <strong>5 additional SCOI entitlements</strong> each year</li>
            <li>Continue accessing applicable longitudinal revisions</li>
            <li>Maintain the institutional membership in good standing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="rights">
        <div class="cell">
          <h4>Lifetime Membership Right</h4>
          <p>The membership entitlement is transferable to another eligible institution, subject to membership terms.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cell">
          <h4>Strictly 100 Seats</h4>
          <p>Only 100 founding memberships will ever be issued. Each carries a sequential founding number.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cell">
          <h4>Institutional, Not Individual</h4>
          <p>Built for research teams, desks and libraries - five named users under one standing window.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="math">
        <span>At catalogue rates, 100 special reports run well beyond</span>
        <b>US$29,900+</b>
        <span>- the founding membership resets that to</span>
        <b>US$50</b>
        <span>a report.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="final">
        {{#if soldOut}}
          <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--gold2)">Fully Subscribed</p>
          <h2>The founding cohort is closed.</h2>
          <p>All 100 memberships have been issued. You can still purchase individual SCOI reports from the library.</p>
          <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/scoi">Browse the SCOI library</a>
        {{else}}
          <p class="eyebrow" style="color:var(--gold2)">{{remaining}} of 100 remaining</p>
          <h2>Take a founding seat.</h2>
          <p>Join the Founders 100 and convert a one-time institutional commitment into a permanent, transferable research window.</p>
          {{#if membership}}
            <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/founders/portal">Go to your portal →</a>
          {{else}}
            <a class="btn btn-gold" href="/founders/checkout">Become a Founding Member · US$5,000</a>
          {{/if}}
        {{/if}}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    CRIPFCnt Resources Limited · SCOI - Structural Causation of Outcome Index · Recalibrate. Don't Motivate.
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
